"y0": 0.11344211344211344, "x1": 0.2153846153846154, "y1": 0.12276612276612277}, {"text": "Attempt Question 2", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.12975912975912976, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.14219114219114218}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.14685314685314685, "x1": 0.4714285714285714, "y1": 0.1561771561771562}, {"text": "Your answer will be assessed on how well you:", "x0": 0.13626373626373625, "y0": 0.17637917637917638, "x1": 0.5197802197802198, "y1": 0.20279720279720279}, {"text": "\u00a9 demonstrate understanding of a text\u2019s distinctive qualities and how", "x0": 0.1967032967032967, "y0": 0.20590520590520592, "x1": 0.7648351648351648, "y1": 0.2191142191142191}, {"text": "these shape meaning", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.2222222222222222, "x1": 0.3923076923076923, "y1": 0.23543123543123542}, {"text": "\u00a9 organise, develop and express ideas using language appropriate to", "x0": 0.1967032967032967, "y0": 0.24397824397824397, "x1": 0.7571428571428571, "y1": 0.2571872571872572}, {"text": "audience, purpose and form", "x0": 0.22637362637362637, "y0": 0.2602952602952603, "x1": 0.44945054945054946, "y1": 0.27350427350427353}, {"text": "Question 2 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.13516483516483516, "y0": 0.2975912975912976, "x1": 0.3208791208791209, "y1": 0.31002331002331}, {"text": "Behind us, the city", "x0": 0.25824175824175827, "y0": 0.3395493395493395, "x1": 0.3956043956043956, "y1": 0.351981351981352}, {"text": "driven like stakes into the earth.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.3550893550893551, "x1": 0.49230769230769234, "y1": 0.3644133644133644}, {"text": "\u2018A waterbird lifts above this swamp", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.36985236985236986, "x1": 0.5153846153846153, "y1": 0.3822843822843823}, {"text": "as a turtle moves on the Galapagos shore.", "x0": 0.2571428571428571, "y0": 0.38461538461538464, "x1": 0.5626373626373626, "y1": 0.39704739704739705}, {"text": "Use these lines of poetry from Flames and Dangling Wire as the starting point", "x0": 0.13736263736263737, "y0": 0.4149184149184149, "x1": 0.7153846153846154, "y1": 0.42657342657342656}, {"text": "for an analysis of how Robert Gray represents the relationship between humans", "x0": 0.13736263736263737, "y0": 0.4296814296814297, "x1": 0.7230769230769231, "y1": 0.4421134421134421}, {"text": "and the environment.", "x0": 0.13626373626373625, "y0": 0.4444444444444444, "x1": 0.29120879120879123, "y1": 0.45376845376845376}, {"text": "In your response, make close reference to \u2018Flames and Dangling Wire\u2019 and at least ONE other poem", "x0": 0.13736263736263737, "y0": 0.47474747474747475, "x1": 0.8802197802197802, "y1": 0.48717948717948717}, {"text": "set for study.", "x0": 0.13626373626373625, "y0": 0.4902874902874903, "x1": 0.23076923076923078, "y1": 0.5027195027195027}, {"text": "A list of prescribed texts for Section II is on page 5.", "x0": 0.24505494505494504, "y0": 0.5835275835275835, "x1": 0.6505494505494506, "y1": 0.6076146076146076}], [{"text": "The prescribed texts for Section II are:", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.0777000777000777, "x1": 0.4307692307692308, "y1": 0.09090909090909091}, {"text": "\u2014 MT Anderson, Feed", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.11965811965811966, "x1": 0.48021978021978023, "y1": 0.1320901320901321}, {"text": "Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.12043512043512043, "x1": 0.256043956043956, "y1": 0.12975912975912976}, {"text": "\u2014 Mark Haddon, The Curious Incident of the Dog in the Night-time", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.14996114996114995, "x1": 0.8395604395604396, "y1": 0.16317016317016317}, {"text": "\u2014 Robert Gray, Coast Road", "x0": 0.2857142857142857, "y0": 0.1919191919191919, "x1": 0.5164835164835165, "y1": 0.20512820512820512}, {"text": "Poetry", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.1926961926961927, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.20512820512820512}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.21522921522921523, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.22843822843822845}, {"text": "* Journey, the North Coast", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.23853923853923853, "x1": 0.5384615384615384, "y1": 0.2517482517482518}, {"text": "* Flames and Dangling Wire", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.2556332556332556, "x1": 0.5538461538461539, "y1": 0.26884226884226886}, {"text": "* Harbour Dusk", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.27195027195027194, "x1": 0.45054945054945056, "y1": 0.28205128205128205}, {"text": "* Byron Bay: Winter", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.28826728826728826, "x1": 0.4868131868131868, "y1": 0.3014763014763015}, {"text": "* Description of a Walk", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.29836829836829837, "x1": 0.512087912087912, "y1": 0.32167832167832167}, {"text": "* 24 Poems", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.32245532245532244, "x1": 0.41208791208791207, "y1": 0.33255633255633255}, {"text": "Oodgeroo Noonuccal", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.351981351981352, "x1": 0.48131868131868133, "y1": 0.3651903651903652}, {"text": "The prescribed poems are:", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.3752913752913753, "x1": 0.521978021978022, "y1": 0.3885003885003885}, {"text": "* The Past", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.3986013986013986, "x1": 0.4043956043956044, "y1": 0.4087024087024087}, {"text": "* China... Woman", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4156954156954157, "x1": 0.4736263736263736, "y1": 0.4257964257964258}, {"text": "* Reed Flute Cave", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.432012432012432, "x1": 0.46813186813186813, "y1": 0.4421134421134421}, {"text": "* Entombed Warriors", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4491064491064491, "x1": 0.49340659340659343, "y1": 0.4592074592074592}, {"text": "* Visit to Sun Yat-Sen Memorial Hall", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4654234654234654, "x1": 0.621978021978022, "y1": 0.4755244755244755}, {"text": "* Sunrise on Huampu River", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4825174825174825, "x1": 0.5439560439560439, "y1": 0.49572649572649574}, {"text": "* A Lake Within a Lake", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.4988344988344988, "x1": 0.5087912087912088, "y1": 0.508935508935509}, {"text": "Scott Rankin, Namatjira from Namatjira & Ngapartji", "x0": 0.3120879120879121, "y0": 0.5407925407925408, "x1": 0.7450549450549451, "y1": 0.554001554001554}, {"text": "Drama", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.5415695415695416, "x1": 0.2021978021978022, "y1": 0.5508935508935509}, {"text": "Ngapartji \u2014 Two plays by Scott Rankin", "x0": 0.3098901098901099, "y0": 0.5578865578865578, "x1": 0.6230769230769231, "y1": 0.5710955710955711}, {"text": "William Shakespeare, A Midsummer Night\u2019s Dream", "x0": 0.3120879120879121, "y0": 0.5990675990675991, "x1": 0.7318681318681318, "y1": 0.6122766122766122}, {"text": "Anna Funder, Stasiland", "x0": 0.310989010989011, "y0": 0.6410256410256411, "x1": 0.5010989010989011, "y1": 0.6534576534576535}, {"text": "Nonfiction", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.6418026418026418, "x1": 0.23186813186813188, "y1": 0.6511266511266511}, {"text": "Peter Weir, The Truman Show", "x0": 0.3120879120879121, "y0": 0.682983682983683, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.6946386946386947}, {"text": "Film", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.6837606837606838, "x1": 0.1824175824175824, "y1": 0.6930846930846931}, {"text": "Simon Nasht, Frank Hurley: The Man Who Made History", "x0": 0.3120879120879121, "y0": 0.7249417249417249, "x1": 0.7802197802197802, "y1": 0.7381507381507382}, {"text": "Media", "x0": 0.14395604395604394, "y0": 0.7257187257187258, "x1": 0.1967032967032967, "y1": 0.7350427350427351}, {"text": "End of Section II", "x0": 0.41208791208791207, "y0": 0.83993783993784, "x1": 0.5560439560439561, "y1": 0.85003885003885}], [{"text": "Section III \u2014 Module C: The Craft of Writing", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.08080808080808081, "x1": 0.589010989010989, "y1": 0.09634809634809635}, {"text": "20 marks", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.11965811965811966, "x1": 0.1989010989010989, "y1": 0.128982128982129}, {"text": "Attempt Question 3", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.13597513597513597, "x1": 0.2879120879120879, "y1": 0.14840714840714841}, {"text": "Allow about 40 minutes for this section", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.16938616938616938, "x1": 0.45604395604395603, "y1": 0.17871017871017872}, {"text": "Your answer will be a", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2128982128982129, "x1": 0.2956043956043956, "y1": 0.222999222999223}, {"text": "ed on how well you:", "x0": 0.3373626373626374, "y0": 0.2128982128982129, "x1": 0.5032967032967033, "y1": 0.2261072261072261}, {"text": "s the demands of the question", "x0": 0.3637362637362637, "y0": 0.22999222999222999, "x1": 0.6021978021978022, "y1": 0.2494172494172494}, {"text": "\u00a9 craft language to addres:", "x0": 0.14285714285714285, "y0": 0.2331002331002331, "x1": 0.35824175824175825, "y1": 0.2463092463092463}, {"text": "use language appropriate to audience, purpose and form to shape meaning", "x0": 0.16703296703296702, "y0": 0.25252525252525254, "x1": 0.7626373626373626, "y1": 0.26573426573426573}, {"text": "Question 3 (20 marks)", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.2913752913752914, "x1": 0.30439560439560437, "y1": 0.3038073038073038}, {"text": "The house fell back against the liquid copper sky, a shell of its former self. Its once vibrant personality was gone.", "x0": 0.12087912087912088, "y0": 0.31546231546231546, "x1": 0.9538461538461539, "y1": 0.34032634032634035}, {"text": "Like a tapestry whose threads had been pulled at random and at various levels of force by a bored child ~ its", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.331002331002331, "x1": 0.921978021978022, "y1": 0.35586635586635584}, {"text": "coherency and ability to function was gone. Lost. Entering the once dominant doorway, dry and cracked paint", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.35353535353535354, "x1": 0.932967032967033, "y1": 0.36596736596736595}, {"text": "hang forlornly and cresifallen from the once proud facade - yet one aspect remained and had aged more", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.3682983682983683, "x1": 0.8923076923076924, "y1": 0.38073038073038074}, {"text": "gracefully. Her photo wall.", "x0": 0.11868131868131868, "y0": 0.38306138306138304, "x1": 0.3153846153846154, "y1": 0.3954933954933955}, {"text": "(a) Continue this extract as a piece of imaginative, discursive, or persuasive writing that explores the impact of", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.4156954156954157, "x1": 0.9439560439560439, "y1": 0.4281274281274281}, {"text": "time. 10 marks", "x0": 0.14945054945054945, "y0": 0.42735042735042733, "x1": 0.9263736263736264, "y1": 0.445998445998446}, {"text": "Note: You are NOT required to write out the extract as part of your response.", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.46076146076146074, "x1": 0.689010989010989, "y1": 0.4731934731934732}, {"text": "(b) Compare how you have used language in part (a) to explore the impact of time with the way writing has been", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5058275058275058, "x1": 0.9527472527472527, "y1": 0.5182595182595182}, {"text": "crafted in ONE prescribed text from Module C. 10 marks", "x0": 0.11978021978021978, "y0": 0.5205905205905206, "x1": 0.9263736263736264, "y1": 0.533022533022533}, {"text": "A list of prescribed texts for Section III is on page 7.", "x0": 0.26703296703296703, "y0": 0.6045066045066045, "x1": 0.6791208791208792, "y1": 0.6285936285936286}], [{"text": "The prescribed texts for Section III are:", "x0": 0.13076923076923078, "y0": 0.09168609168609168, "x1": 0.44945054945054946, "y1": 0.1048951048951049}, {"text": "\u2014 Ray Bradbury, The Pedestrian", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.13286713286713286, "x1": 0.6703296703296703, "y1": 0.14607614607614608}, {"text": "Prose Fiction", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.13364413364413363, "x1": 0.3076923076923077, "y1": 0.14296814296814297}, {"text": "\u2014 Peter Carey, Report on the Shadow Industry", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.16317016317016317, "x1": 0.7813186813186813, "y1": 0.17637917637917638}, {"text": "\u2014 Catherine Cole, Home", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.19347319347319347, "x1": 0.6032967032967033, "y1": 0.20590520590520592}, {"text": "\u2014 Stephen King, Crouch End", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.22377622377622378, "x1": 0.643956043956044, "y1": 0.236985236985237}, {"text": "\u2014 Melissa Lucashenko, Dreamers", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.2540792540792541, "x1": 0.6791208791208792, "y1": 0.26573426573426573}, {"text": "\u2014 Helen Gamer, Dear Mrs Dunkley", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.29603729603729606, "x1": 0.6956043956043956, "y1": 0.30924630924630925}, {"text": "Nonfiction", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.29681429681429683, "x1": 0.27802197802197803, "y1": 0.3061383061383061}, {"text": "~ George Orwell, The Sporting Spirit", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.32556332556332557, "x1": 0.710989010989011, "y1": 0.33877233877233875}, {"text": "\u2014 Sylvia Plath, A Comparison", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.35586635586635584, "x1": 0.6483516483516484, "y1": 0.3690753690753691}, {"text": "Sarah Vowell, What He Said There", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.3861693861693862, "x1": 0.7098901098901099, "y1": 0.3986013986013986}, {"text": "Speeches", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.41181041181041184, "x1": 0.2714285714285714, "y1": 0.425019425019425}, {"text": "\u2014 Linda Burney, First speech to the House of", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.41181041181041184, "x1": 0.7769230769230769, "y1": 0.425019425019425}, {"text": "Representatives as Member for Barton", "x0": 0.1945054945054945, "y0": 0.4281274281274281, "x1": 0.5065934065934066, "y1": 0.44133644133644134}, {"text": "\u2014 Steve Jobs, How to Live Before You Die", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.45843045843045843, "x1": 0.7505494505494505, "y1": 0.4716394716394716}, {"text": "\u2014 Paul Keating, Funeral Service of The Unknown", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.4887334887334887, "x1": 0.8043956043956044, "y1": 0.5019425019425019}, {"text": "Australian Soldier", "x0": 0.4230769230769231, "y0": 0.5050505050505051, "x1": 0.5758241758241758, "y1": 0.5151515151515151}, {"text": "\u2014 JK Rowling, The Fringe Benefits of Failure", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.5353535353535354, "x1": 0.7813186813186813, "y1": 0.5485625485625486}, {"text": "and the Importance of Imagination", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.5516705516705517, "x1": 0.7043956043956044, "y1": 0.5648795648795649}, {"text": "\u2014 Carol Chan, Popcorn", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.5936285936285937, "x1": 0.5945054945054945, "y1": 0.6068376068376068}, {"text": "Poetry", "x0": 0.189010989010989, "y0": 0.5944055944055944, "x1": 0.24395604395604395, "y1": 0.6068376068376068}, {"text": "\u2014 Robert Frost, Stopping By Woods on a Snowy Evening", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.6239316239316239, "x1": 0.865934065934066, "y1": 0.6371406371406372}, {"text": "\u2014 Les Murray, An Absolutely Ordinary Rainbow", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.6542346542346542, "x1": 0.8, "y1": 0.6674436674436675}, {"text": "\u2014 Judith Wright, The Surfer", "x0": 0.4, "y0": 0.6837606837606838, "x1": 0.6318681318681318, "y1": 0.696969696969697}, {"text": "Performance", "x0": 0.1956043956043956, "y0": 0.7101787101787101, "x1": 0.3054945054945055, "y1": 0.7195027195027195}, {"text": "\u2014 Luka Lesson, May your pen grace the page", "x0": 0.3978021978021978, "y0": 0.7350427350427351, "x1": 0.7747252747252747, "y1": 0.7482517482517482}, {"text": "Poetry", "x0": 0.1978021978021978, "y0": 0.7358197358197358, "x1": 0.25274725274725274, "y1": 0.7482517482517482}, {"text": "End of Section III", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.8508158508158508, "x1": 0.5758241758241758, "y1": 0.8601398601398601}, {"text": "End of Paper 2", "x0": 0.42417582417582417, "y0": 0.8671328671328671, "x1": 0.5516483516483517, "y1": 0.8795648795648796}, {"text": "7", "x0": 0.4846153846153846, "y0": 0.8997668997668997, "x1": 0.49230769230769234, "y1": 0.9083139083139083}], [{"text": "BLANK PAGE", "x0": 0.45164835164835165, "y0": 0.3923853923853924, "x1": 0.5483516483516484, "y1": 0.40093240093240096}]]